&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-v47zm2-FocusContainer e1ge5hpl0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-1mb50em-EditorContainer e1ge5hpl1&quot; data-automation-id=&quot;richTextEditor&quot; data-metadata-id=&quot;56$309310&quot; data-uxi-widget-editable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-1v6ili8-TextEditorContainer eg1t6ed0&quot; data-automation-id=&quot;richTextContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-ehfww1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ProseMirror&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Application of laws and regulations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must understand the laws and regulations related to occupational safety and health/hygiene, and the ability to operate procedures and systems required by relevant laws and regulations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish the standard procedures/guidelines for occupational safety and health/hygiene and management of compliance with laws and regulations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Occupational safety and health/sanitation management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Formulate and manage policies on occupational safety and health/hygiene to prevent industrial incidents&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Implement, evaluate and improve measures for occupational safety and health/hygiene&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct risk assessment and measures based on the results&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct occupational safety and health/sanitation education and take measures to maintain the health of workers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage medical checkups and stress check and promote the health maintenance activities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Organize and manage the health/hygiene committee (衛生委員会)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Investigate the root cause of industrial incidents and implement measures to prevent recurrence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage fire prevention in the workplace&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inspect and maintain the emergency kits and the fire prevention equipment, etc&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Statistics on workers&#39; injuries and illnesses, resulting deaths, absences and transfers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Record and maintain occupational safety and health/hygiene data&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Organize occupational safety and health/hygiene issues and work closely with stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Perform direct or indirect job of business-related government agencies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-pm-slice=&quot;3 1 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Type 2 Health Supervisor License or Type 1 Health Supervisor License or Hygiene Engineering Hygiene Supervisor License&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A person deemed to have the necessary knowledge and experience as a person who has completed fire prevention management classes or as a fire prevention manager (a person prescribed in Article 3 -1- 1 (b), (c) of the Enforcement Decree of the Fire Protection Act and Article 2 of the Enforcement Rules of the Fire Protection Act)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native or having a equivalent to Native level Japanese capability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At least 5 years of experience in EHS&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experienced in responding to government agencies, such as the Labor Office and the Fire Department, etc&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
