&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in manufacturing, or logistics and delivery industries&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experienced EHS experience in multinational companies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capability of proactively communicating with the stakeholders, self learning and demonstrate the problem solving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
