&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;ajifu-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;ajifu-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Teaching&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;ajifu-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; — Works cross-functionally, shares knowledge, and coaches peers on automation and new tools. Makes the team around them better.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
