&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;engbv-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;engbv-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Communication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;engbv-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; — Simplifies financial complexity for non-finance stakeholders at all levels. Comfortable working across global teams and time zones.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
