&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Demonstrated ability to work with RTL teams to optimize for physical design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Knowledge of 2.5D or 3D packaging solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Must have experience with 3d physical design, 3d die stacking, 3d chip design, die-to-die or wafer-to-wafer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
